{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679900/extras/c3b931254a8bb0abb912ab2204a6f2df.avif?t=1768988665\" width=377 height=480 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Add to wishlist!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GUNtai is a weapon-building action roguelike. Your build is your weapon</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build weapons without restrictions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you think your pistol needs a sniper scope? What about make it belt-fed? Maybe add a underbarrel SMG? With an under-underbarrel shotgun! Connect the weapon parts as you want without any restrictions!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wide range of modules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can assemble a modern tactical assault rifle, a high-tech laser gun, or something straight from the Khyber Pass. Or mix it all together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your agent</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each agent has a unique ability, a signature weapon, and their own personal soundtrack.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3679900?t=1768988665","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3679900?t=1768988665","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679900/cd2c5aca249ec09ec0776ce7952ec297c4bbf16c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768988665","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679900/cd2c5aca249ec09ec0776ce7952ec297c4bbf16c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768988665","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detai